<th id="S4.T1.3.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r">MMM <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib26" title="" class="ltx_ref">33</a>]</cite></th>
